# 🦦 The Pwning Otter

> Stay Curious. Test Responsibly. Keep Pwning.

A hands-on penetration testing lab documenting my journey through offensive security, ethical hacking, vulnerability assessment, and certification preparation.

---

## 🎯 Project Goals

The purpose of this project is to develop practical penetration testing skills through a self-hosted virtual lab environment.

### Objectives

- Learn penetration testing methodologies
- Practice reconnaissance and enumeration
- Identify and validate vulnerabilities
- Perform exploitation in a safe environment
- Improve technical documentation skills
- Gain experience writing professional pentest reports
- Prepare for penetration testing certifications

